                        "review": "I purchased this game because no one has reviewed it and it looked decent. However this game is truly terrible and not worth five dollars. I wouldnt have this in my library even if it was free. You are literally dropped into a random battlefield with nothing told to you; there are numbers at the top of the screen, what are they? No one was playing the game. No exaggerating, no one was playing the game. I must ask, why the hell did you release this game when it is so flawed? The game looks terrible, there is motion blur and sensitivity that you cannot change in the settings. Overall this game is flawed beyond fixing.",
